{"id":"5490","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5490_main_cirrus-uncinus-cirrocumulogenitus-cirrocumulus-castellanus-undulatus-and-floccus-with-virga_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>卷积云和卷云是这个看似混乱天空中的两个主要云型。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">从共同云底升起的锯齿状的极小角塔</span> 是堡状卷积云；这些云底部分呈平行线排列，表明是波状云类，这可通过观测在卷状云估测高度上的东风加以确定。在某些部分，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状卷积云</span> 从堡状云发展而来，冰晶雨幡驱散了后者的云底。絮状卷积云在逐步发展为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩状的逗号（钩卷云）</span>。在照片上部还有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">不规则的弯曲丝条（毛卷云）</span>。总之，钩卷云和毛卷云多于卷积云，因此，编码为CH = 1。</p>\n<p>此外还有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">一块高积云</span>，而且至少有四个凝迹，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">7</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">8</span>可见。位置是在暖空气中，并受对流层上部极弱短波低压槽的影响。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Martin Gudd","location":"德国，巴特克罗伊茨纳赫","latitude":"纬度: 49° 50' 39'' N","longitude":"经度: 7° 50' 32'' E","date":"07 December 2015 1614 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.17","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.17"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5490_syn_cirrus-uncinus-cirrocumulogenitus-cirrocumulus-castellanus-undulatus-and-floccus-with-virga_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>天气图为照片拍摄前约三小时的天气形势。德国大部分地区均处于来自欧洲西南部的暖空气控制之下。下午的温度通常超过10 °C。在这股暖空气中，有一些高云和中云发展，并从南向北飘移，这是由于对流层上部弱短波低压槽所致。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Verein Berliner Wetterkarte e.V.","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5490_upper_cirrus-uncinus-cirrocumulogenitus-cirrocumulus-castellanus-undulatus-and-floccus-with-virga_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>探测发现在7600米和9200米有离散水汽层。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5490_sat_cirrus-uncinus-cirrocumulogenitus-cirrocumulus-castellanus-undulatus-and-floccus-with-virga_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>图为照片拍摄前几小时的天气形势。有两个主要锋系：暖锋，从冰岛经北海一直延伸至德国北部地区；冷锋，从冰岛向南延伸至爱尔兰和比斯开湾。德国大部分地区均处在西南暖气流的影响下，其中有中云和高云发展。对流层上部弱短波低压槽在比荷卢和德国西部带来了小块的中云和高云。该云并未带来降水。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Verein Berliner Wetterkarte e.V.","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4806_main_cirrus-uncinus-cirrocumulogenitus-and-cirrocumulus-floccus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>该图像中的主要云是钩卷云。钩状云是白色的并且是逗号形状，顶部以<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩子</span>或<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">簇</span>的形式终止，其上部不是圆形突起的形式。</p>\n<p>还存在絮状卷积云，从中还开展形成了钩卷云。絮状卷积云很明显，其中明显的是几个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">非常小元素的薄白色斑块</span>，其中一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">较低的部分是不规则的</span>。</p>\n<p>毛卷云也正在发展，风使得钩状逗号变形成为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">不规则弯曲或接近直的细丝</span>。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Rob Lindberg","location":"美国爱达荷州Meridian","latitude":"纬度: 43° 35' 57'' N","longitude":"经度: 116° 25' 24'' W","date":"09 June 2015 0830 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.17","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.17"}]}]}